// Process Started by the PsExec Service
// Sigma rule: rules/sigma/windows/win_psexec_service_child_process.yml (4ef84875-1887-4641-848b-2a1238b59494)
// Level: medium. ATT&CK: T1569.002 Service Execution, T1021.002 SMB/Windows Admin Shares
// Generated by `python -m detlab build`. Change the Sigma rule, not this file.
any where (event.provider:"Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon" and event.code:"1") and process.parent.executable:"*\\PSEXESVC.exe"
